# rclone configs (contain OAuth refresh tokens for Google Drive).
# These normally live in ~/.config/rclone/rclone.conf, not the repo,
# but this is a belt-and-suspenders guard against an accidental copy
# into the working tree.
rclone.conf
*.rclone.conf

